      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-12-27T19:04:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've heard tale of others swapping things up in the start-up kit, so it's nothing unheard of. If you think changing some fights up in the adventure would keep your players on their toes and preserve the friendly vibe around the table, then I say go for it. Maybe change around some events that won't inconvenience the overarching plot, or add a few new enemies or hinderances or what-have-you.</p>",
