      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/{size}/1944_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-01-16T22:13:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Gotta love metagaming players.&nbsp; Not sure if you've tried talking to the group (and not singling this person out) about your expectations.&nbsp; If I'm running an RPG from a sourcebook, I tend to make it clear that they should avoid reading it at all costs.&nbsp; Not in the context of \"You'll be punished\" but rather \"You'll ruin the fun for yourselves and everyone else.\"&nbsp; That's never failed me before.&nbsp; Turns out that most people stop making stupid decisions when they know they'll be letting their friends down.</p>",
