      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/epicraiz/{size}/2000_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-02-03T03:15:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you everyone for the input and ideas. Talking to the guy about metagaming won't work, he seems to be narcissistic but wants the admiration of others as well. Another guy wanted to always succeed, even if it meant fudging dice rolls or purposefully doing basic math wrong. The fun that twists have introduced for the players though has actually encouraged meta-guy to accept failure.</p>",
