      "username": "Phantom5613",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-02-03T19:24:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm glad that things are working out for you and your group. :D That's the thing about the Gyro system and having Major and minor twists;</p>\n<p>Failing a roll does not mean failure. Getting hit just makes you stronger. Playing to your principals means you are good in your area, so let your teammates cover your back and handle their own specialties.</p>\n<p>I haven't had the chance to play too much of the system yet, but there's a good chance it will become my go-to for difficult players.</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:58:17.520Z",
