      "raw": "[quote=\"jlabrecque42\"]\n\nMetagaming this system will just make for a boring story.&nbsp; Maybe turn it around on them.&nbsp; Create your own metagame where each of the comic writers are competing for issue sales.&nbsp; The hero with the best role playing, most creative use of powers, and overcomming to hardest failure us able to sell the most issues that month. Kind of a game outside the game. :)\n\n[/quote]\n\nI remember some folks being discouraged by early descriptions of the RPG as \"you're a bunch of comic writers working on a story\" rather than \"you're a bunch of super heroes trying to stop a crime\", but this is some seriously excellent advice. I'd say it's also proof you can approach the system either way.\n",
